<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged up to 1.8913 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged up to 1.8913 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8913 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.893 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 15	    January 14</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.8913		  1.8930</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $39.94 million	    $2.74 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
